  "description": "A powered evaporative cooler for occupied sietch rooms. It uses sealed water rations in wetted pads to carry heat away as vapor, without a hot exhaust tile. Thick-rock shelter greatly reduces its water demand. Requires electricity and hauled water; stops when either runs out. Its lowest target is 18 C, so use a sealed climate cooler for refrigeration. The reservoir is refilled when empty. Dismantling returns whole unused rations; water already wetting the pads is lost.",
